        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld dBm"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld dBm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 小時": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 Hour"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 小時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10 秒後鎖定這台 Mac，動一下滑鼠或鍵盤可以取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Locking this Mac in 10 seconds. Move the mouse or press a key to cancel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 秒後鎖定這台 Mac，動一下滑鼠或鍵盤可以取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "15 分鐘": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "15 Minutes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "15 分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4 小時": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4 Hours"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4 小時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Watch 請戴在手上。這個位置的訊號會用來決定解鎖門檻。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wear your Apple Watch. The signal here sets the unlock threshold."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Watch 請戴在手上。這個位置的訊號會用來決定解鎖門檻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence 上次沒有正常結束（可能是當機或被系統結束），已重新開啟": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence didn't quit normally last time (it may have crashed or been terminated by the system) and has been reopened"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence 上次沒有正常結束（可能是當機或被系統結束），已重新開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence 不存密碼，也不需要輔助使用權限：你回來時它只喚醒螢幕，由 macOS 內建的「用 Apple Watch 解鎖」或 Touch ID 完成解鎖。要先在「系統設定 › 觸控 ID 與密碼」開啟用 Apple Watch 解鎖。這是最安全的用法。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence stores no password and needs no Accessibility permission: when you return, it only wakes the display, and macOS's built-in Apple Watch unlock or Touch ID does the unlocking. Turn on Apple Watch unlock in System Settings › Touch ID & Password first. This is the most secure option."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence 不存密碼，也不需要輔助使用權限：你回來時它只喚醒螢幕，由 macOS 內建的「用 Apple Watch 解鎖」或 Touch ID 完成解鎖。要先在「系統設定 › 觸控 ID 與密碼」開啟用 Apple Watch 解鎖。這是最安全的用法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence 已啟動": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence started"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence 已啟動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence 會先確認這是「%@」的登入密碼，再存進鑰匙圈。只有自動解鎖時才會讀出來，不會寫進任何紀錄。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence checks that this is the login password for “%@” before saving it to your keychain. It's read only when unlocking automatically and is never written to any log."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence 會先確認這是「%@」的登入密碼，再存進鑰匙圈。只有自動解鎖時才會讀出來，不會寫進任何紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence 的想法來自 Takeshi Sone 的 BLEUnlock（MIT 授權），為新版 macOS 重新設計與實作。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence is based on BLEUnlock by Takeshi Sone (MIT License), redesigned and rewritten for current macOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence 的想法來自 Takeshi Sone 的 BLEUnlock（MIT 授權），為新版 macOS 重新設計與實作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence 目前在「%@」。不在「應用程式」資料夾時，Mac 睡眠後可能被系統結束，登入時也可能開不起來。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence is in “%@”. Outside the Applications folder, macOS may terminate it while the Mac sleeps, and it may not open at login."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence 目前在「%@」。不在「應用程式」資料夾時，Mac 睡眠後可能被系統結束，登入時也可能開不起來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence 自動解鎖用的登入密碼": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Login password Presence uses to unlock automatically"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence 自動解鎖用的登入密碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence 還沒有啟動": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence isn't running"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence 還沒有啟動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence 鎖定時執行「離開時」的捷徑，之後解鎖時執行「回來時」的捷徑。例如離開時開啟專注模式、把 Slack 狀態改成離座、關燈，回來時再恢復。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence runs the “When leaving” shortcut when it locks your Mac, and the “When returning” shortcut when you unlock it afterward. For example, turn on a Focus, set your Slack status to away, or turn off the lights when you leave, and undo it when you return."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence 鎖定時執行「離開時」的捷徑，之後解鎖時執行「回來時」的捷徑。例如離開時開啟專注模式、把 Slack 狀態改成離座、關燈，回來時再恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RSSI": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RSSI"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RSSI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 沒有回應加密確認，這次不自動解鎖。請確認 iPhone 上的 Presence Remote 沒有被關掉，而且是最新版。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone didn't answer the encrypted confirmation, so the Mac wasn't unlocked automatically. Make sure Presence Remote on your iPhone hasn't been closed and is up to date."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 沒有回應加密確認，這次不自動解鎖。請確認 iPhone 上的 Presence Remote 沒有被關掉，而且是最新版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 連著但沒有回應，請更新 Presence Remote": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone is connected but didn't answer. Update Presence Remote."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 連著但沒有回應，請更新 Presence Remote"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一般": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "General"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一般"
          }
        }
      }
    },
