    "依裝置在附近的時間計算；離開不到 3 分鐘（例如去倒杯水）算同一段。紀錄只存在這台 Mac 上，保留 60 天。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Based on when your devices are nearby. Breaks shorter than 3 minutes (like grabbing a drink) count as the same stretch. History stays on this Mac for 60 days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依裝置在附近的時間計算；離開不到 3 分鐘（例如去倒杯水）算同一段。紀錄只存在這台 Mac 上，保留 60 天。"
