    "回傳目前的狀態，例如「Weichung 在附近 · -52 dBm」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Returns the current status, such as “iPhone nearby · -52 dBm”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回傳目前的狀態，例如「Weichung 在附近 · -52 dBm」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Finder 顯示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show in Finder"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Finder 顯示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 iPhone 安裝 Presence Remote 並配對後，可以從手機、Apple Watch、Siri 或「捷徑」立即鎖定這台 Mac、暫停或恢復，Mac 鎖定時也會通知你。連線走藍牙，指令都經過加密；Apple Watch 會透過 iPhone 取得同一組配對。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After pairing Presence Remote on your iPhone, you can lock this Mac, pause, or resume from your iPhone, Apple Watch, Siri, or Shortcuts, and get notified when your Mac locks. The connection uses Bluetooth and every command is encrypted; your Apple Watch gets the same pairing through your iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 安裝 Presence Remote 並配對後，可以從手機、Apple Watch、Siri 或「捷徑」立即鎖定這台 Mac、暫停或恢復，Mac 鎖定時也會通知你。連線走藍牙，指令都經過加密；Apple Watch 會透過 iPhone 取得同一組配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 iPhone 打開 Presence Remote，點「掃描 QR code」，對準下面的圖。這個 QR code 含有配對用的金鑰，請不要拍給別人。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Presence Remote on your iPhone, tap Scan QR Code, and point it at the code below. This QR code contains the pairing key, so don't share a photo of it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 打開 Presence Remote，點「掃描 QR code」，對準下面的圖。這個 QR code 含有配對用的金鑰，請不要拍給別人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在「%@」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On “%@”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「%@」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在「手機與手錶」配對 iPhone 後才能使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pair an iPhone in Phone & Watch to use this"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「手機與手錶」配對 iPhone 後才能使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在任何 App 裡按下快捷鍵就會立即鎖定。「捷徑」App 裡也有 Presence 的動作（立即鎖定、暫停、恢復、取得狀態），可以接進自動化，或在終端機用 shortcuts run 執行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press the shortcut in any app to lock right away. The Shortcuts app also has Presence actions (Lock Now, Pause, Resume, Get Status) for automations, or run them in Terminal with shortcuts run."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何 App 裡按下快捷鍵就會立即鎖定。「捷徑」App 裡也有 Presence 的動作（立即鎖定、暫停、恢復、取得狀態），可以接進自動化，或在終端機用 shortcuts run 執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在座時間": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desk Time"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在座時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在指定的時間內不自動鎖定，也不自動解鎖。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don't lock or unlock automatically for the specified time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在指定的時間內不自動鎖定，也不自動解鎖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在這個位置放一個名為 event 的可執行檔，鎖定或解鎖時會帶參數執行：away（訊號變弱而鎖定）、lost（收不到訊號而鎖定）、unlocked（自動解鎖）、intruded（裝置不在時被手動解鎖）。第二個參數是當時的訊號強度。與 BLEUnlock 相容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put an executable named event here and it runs on lock and unlock with an argument: away (locked because the signal got weak), lost (locked because the signal was lost), unlocked (unlocked automatically), or intruded (unlocked manually while your devices were away). The second argument is the signal strength at that moment. Compatible with BLEUnlock."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這個位置放一個名為 event 的可執行檔，鎖定或解鎖時會帶參數執行：away（訊號變弱而鎖定）、lost（收不到訊號而鎖定）、unlocked（自動解鎖）、intruded（裝置不在時被手動解鎖）。第二個參數是當時的訊號強度。與 BLEUnlock 相容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
