            "value": "接著電源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接著電源時通常放在固定的地方，例如家裡的書桌；帶出門用電池時才自動鎖定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When plugged in, your Mac is usually somewhere fixed, like your desk at home. Lock automatically only when you're out on battery."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接著電源時通常放在固定的地方，例如家裡的書桌；帶出門用電池時才自動鎖定。"
