    "校準時分別站在「希望解鎖」和「希望鎖定」的位置各量 8 秒，會同時算出每台裝置的門檻。數值越接近 0 代表要越近。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calibration measures for 8 seconds where you want to unlock and where you want to lock, then sets thresholds for every device. Values closer to 0 mean closer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "校準時分別站在「希望解鎖」和「希望鎖定」的位置各量 8 秒，會同時算出每台裝置的門檻。數值越接近 0 代表要越近。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
