    "照片只存在這台 Mac 上，30 天後自動刪除，可以在「紀錄」頁查看。拍照時相機的綠燈會亮。如果你自己用 Touch ID 解鎖時剛好偵測不到裝置，也會拍到你自己。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos stay on this Mac, are deleted after 30 days, and can be viewed in History. The camera's green light turns on while taking one. If you unlock with Touch ID while your devices happen to be undetected, it will photograph you too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片只存在這台 Mac 上，30 天後自動刪除，可以在「紀錄」頁查看。拍照時相機的綠燈會亮。如果你自己用 Touch ID 解鎖時剛好偵測不到裝置，也會拍到你自己。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
