    "自動解鎖前會先請 %@ 加密確認。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before unlocking automatically, Presence asks %@ for an encrypted confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動解鎖前會先請 %@ 加密確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動解鎖只看訊號強弱。配對 iPhone 後，可以要求它先加密確認，比較安全。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic unlock relies on signal strength only. Pair an iPhone to require an encrypted confirmation first, which is more secure."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動解鎖只看訊號強弱。配對 iPhone 後，可以要求它先加密確認，比較安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動解鎖只看訊號強弱，iPhone 加密確認已關閉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic unlock relies on signal strength only; iPhone encrypted confirmation is off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動解鎖只看訊號強弱，iPhone 加密確認已關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動解鎖失敗，螢幕仍是鎖定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic unlock failed; the screen is still locked"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動解鎖失敗，螢幕仍是鎖定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動解鎖時用來輸入。會先驗證是否正確，再存進鑰匙圈。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Typed in to unlock automatically. It's verified before being saved to your keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動解鎖時用來輸入。會先驗證是否正確，再存進鑰匙圈。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動解鎖要模擬鍵盤輸入密碼，需要這個權限。到「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 輔助使用」打開 Presence。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unlocking automatically types your password, which requires this permission. Turn on Presence in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動解鎖要模擬鍵盤輸入密碼，需要這個權限。到「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 輔助使用」打開 Presence。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動鎖定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-Lock"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動鎖定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動鎖定與解鎖暫停到 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-lock and unlock paused until %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動鎖定與解鎖暫停到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
