    "靠近時喚醒螢幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wake display when nearby"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "靠近時喚醒螢幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "預設任一台在附近就算你在，全部都離開才會鎖定。例如同時加入 iPhone 和 Apple Watch，手錶訊號變弱時只要手機還在就不會鎖。選「每一台都要在附近」則任一台離開就鎖，比較嚴格。每台裝置的門檻在「鎖定與解鎖」分開設定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default you count as present when any device is nearby, and your Mac locks only when all of them are away. For example, add both your iPhone and Apple Watch: if the watch signal drops, your Mac stays unlocked as long as your iPhone is nearby. Choose “All devices nearby” to lock as soon as any device leaves, which is stricter. Set each device's thresholds in Lock & Unlock."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設任一台在附近就算你在，全部都離開才會鎖定。例如同時加入 iPhone 和 Apple Watch，手錶訊號變弱時只要手機還在就不會鎖。選「每一台都要在附近」則任一台離開就鎖，比較嚴格。每台裝置的門檻在「鎖定與解鎖」分開設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "預設只暫停自動鎖定，回來時仍會自動解鎖。情境結束時如果裝置不在附近，會立刻鎖定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default only auto-lock is paused, and your Mac still unlocks when you return. When the conditions end, your Mac locks right away if your devices aren't nearby."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設只暫停自動鎖定，回來時仍會自動解鎖。情境結束時如果裝置不在附近，會立刻鎖定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
